# Terraform state and backend config — never commit.
**/.terraform/
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
**/terraform.tfstate
**/terraform.tfstate.backup
**/terraform.tfvars
**/*.tfbackend

# Plan output — may contain secrets.
**/*.tfplan
**/plan.out

# Override files.
**/override.tf
**/override.tf.json
**/*_override.tf
**/*_override.tf.json
